# 1.4.0: each piece its own modulation (1.4.3: a target as its setting, 0 Off) (par43: the first voice's second modulator's target; par40 its depth; par201
# the reel's first modulator's target); SEL + SAVE initialises what the page is part of (a voice's MOD pages: its
# modulators), SEL held undoes it; SAVE held (the recipe) is undone the same way; the reel's modulators' pages
wait 300
expect par43 6
expect par201 3
turn PRESET 1
wait 100
expect piece 1
expect par43 7
expect par40 35
expect par201 4
# Voice 1's MOD page: SEL + SAVE, its modulators to their defaults
tap ENV
tap ENV
tap ENV
tap ENV
tap ENV
wait 100
expect view 36
press SEL
tap SAVE
release SEL
wait 100
expect par40 0
expect par43 0
# SEL held: undone
press SEL
wait 1100
release SEL
wait 100
expect par40 35
expect par43 7
# the recipe (SAVE held), undone as well (the second modulator picked: its depth up 5)
turn K1 1 10
spin K3 5
expect par40 40
press SAVE
wait 1700
release SAVE
wait 100
expect par40 35
press SEL
wait 1100
release SEL
wait 100
expect par40 40
# the reel's modulators: SEQ, four times on: Tape Mod 1
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
wait 100
expect view 9
shot tape_mod.png
# the reel's five, as a voice's MOD: KNOB 1 picks the modulator (the second: its target at par207), and they are kept
# (OBJ_TAPE) across a restart
turn K1 1 10
spin K2 4
expect par207 4
tap SAVE
wait 300
reboot
wait 300
expect par207 4
